id: pm-wftvem
title: Route project-schema keys to their declared flags in field refusals
description: "Observed during SDK delivery: update with --field gate_evidence=<JSON> refuses that key as absent from active extension registrations and lists only unrelated extension fields. The same workspace declares gate_evidence as an object field with cli_flag --gate-evidence; schema show-field and update contracts expose it, and the dedicated flag succeeds. Extend field recovery to distinguish configured project-schema fields from extension item fields and provide the executable declared CLI/SDK route. Preserve extension-field admission and no-write refusals. This is a recovery/discovery gap, not a request to bypass schema validation or reinterpret arbitrary extension fields."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-27T22:32:59.271Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-02T01:47:59.396Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-01T21:06:44.522Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-01T21:06:44.522Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: A rejected configured schema key names its declared CLI flag and supported SDK route; Unknown extension and reserved core keys retain distinct typed recovery; Native refused-call tests prove unchanged documents/history and execute the advertised correction
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "parseRegisteredItemFieldAssignments takes a project-schema resolver used by create and update; the refusal project_schema_field_requires_declared_flag names the flag, SDK option and schema show-field; the CLI rewrites the one matching --field token into an executable retry."
expected_result: "An agent repairs a --field gate_evidence call from the refusal alone, without a write."
actual_result: The SDK refusal leaves item and history bytes unchanged and the advertised SDK route succeeds; unknown and core keys keep their own codes.
dependencies[2]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  pm-2jtbl8,related,"2026-10-27T22:32:59.271Z","harness:codex","cli:create:dep",detected
